<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    The moods of the colony's animals in Rimfolk (Source/ColonyCouncil/Animals/): the animals' wishes, personal stories,
    dilemmas, customs and moments. Most good ones give something other than mood (RewardInstead: practice, rest, play,
    a feeling, the journal); the bad ones are small setbacks with hints of their own (Rimfolk_MoodHints_Animals.xml).
  -->

  <!-- ===================== Wishes granted ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Granted_OwnAnimal</defName>
    <durationDays>6</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>an animal of my own</label><description>It answers to me now. I've started on the commands, and it's started on my boots.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Granted_Barn</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>a barn for the herd</label><description>The herd sleeps under a roof now. I went out last night just to hear them breathing in the dark.</description><baseMoodEffect>2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Contentment</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Granted_Mount</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>something to ride</label><description>I rode to the far edge of our land and back before breakfast. My legs ache in new places, and I'm going out again tomorrow.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ===================== Personal stories ===================== -->

  <!-- The old companion: the good days kept. -->
  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Arc_EveryDayAGift</defName>
    <durationDays>6</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>every day with my old friend</label><description>My old friend is still here, gray at the muzzle and warm against my legs in the evenings.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>3</felt><comfort>0.1</comfort><feelings><li>Tenderness</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- The orphan raised by hand: grown. -->
  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Arc_RaisedByHand</defName>
    <durationDays>6</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>raised it by hand</label><description>The little one I fed from a rag is grown now, heavier than a sack of grain, and still thinks it fits in my lap.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>3</felt><skill>Animals</skill><xp>400</xp><feelings><li>Pride</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- The stray: home at last. -->
  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Arc_StrayHome</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>the stray stayed</label><description>The stray that came to the back door for scraps is ours now, with a name and a bowl of its own.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- The feud with an animal: open war, and a grudging peace. -->
  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Arc_FeudWithAnimal</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>at war with an animal</label><description>That animal lies in wait for me in doorways and goes for my boots, and the others find it hilarious.</description><baseMoodEffect>-2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Frustration</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Arc_GrudgingFriends</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>a truce with the beast</label><description>We have an arrangement now, that animal and I: I don't step on it, and it leaves my lunch alone.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt><joy>0.08</joy></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ===================== Dilemmas ===================== -->

  <!-- The herd in a famine. -->
  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_CulledHerd</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>we culled the herd</label><description>I raised some of those animals from the day they were born. It had to be done. I did it properly, and I didn't sleep after.</description><baseMoodEffect>-3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Grief</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_HerdSpared</defName>
    <durationDays>4</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>the herd was spared</label><description>The council could have taken the herd for the pot. It didn't. I won't forget that come spring.</description><baseMoodEffect>2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Gratitude</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_LeanDays</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>lean days for the herd's sake</label><description>Smaller portions at every meal, so the herd can eat too. I scrape the bowl clean and I'm still hungry.</description><baseMoodEffect>-1</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_TurnedOutHerd</defName>
    <durationDays>6</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>we turned the herd out</label><description>We opened the gate and walked away from them. I keep looking for them on the hills.</description><baseMoodEffect>-4</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Grief</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- A wild animal in the crops. -->
  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_FieldWatch</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>watched the fields all night</label><description>I sat out by the crops with a lamp and a pot to bang. It came twice, and went twice. The field is still ours.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt><feelings><li>Resolve</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_LetItGraze</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>let it eat our crops</label><description>An animal ate its way down my rows while we let it be. I went out and counted what was left, and it wasn't much.</description><baseMoodEffect>-2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Frustration</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- A sick animal and the medicine it would take. -->
  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_BestCareForAnimal</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>the good medicine for my animal</label><description>The doctors are treating my animal with the good medicine, the same they'd use on me. I thanked them until they shooed me out.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Gratitude</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_AnimalLeftToFate</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>my animal left to its fate</label><description>No medicine for my animal. It's lying in the straw, and all I can do is sit with it.</description><baseMoodEffect>-4</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Worry</li></feelings><weight>0.4</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_MedicineOnAnimal</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>medicine spent on an animal</label><description>Good medicine, the kind that saves people, poured into an animal. We'll want it back one day.</description><baseMoodEffect>-2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- A predator stalking the pens. -->
  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_WatchAtThePens</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>kept watch at the pens</label><description>A night at the pens with a lantern, a fire and a stick, watching the long grass move. The herd slept through it.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt><feelings><li>Resolve</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- A bond the faith frowns on. -->
  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_BondShamed</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>told my bond is wrong</label><description>They called my bond with my animal a sin and refused to bless it, standing right there at the blessing. I walked out, and it walked out with me.</description><baseMoodEffect>-3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Shame</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_FaithRespected</defName>
    <durationDays>4</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>the faith was honored</label><description>The council listened to what the faith asks, and found an answer I can live with.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt><trust>2</trust></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_GaveUpMyAnimal</defName>
    <durationDays>8</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>gave my animal to someone else</label><description>It answers to someone else now. It still comes to my door in the evening, and I have to send it away.</description><baseMoodEffect>-5</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Grief</li></feelings><weight>0.4</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_DlmA_FaithBrushedAside</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>my faith brushed aside</label><description>The council said my faith has no say over someone else's animal. I said my prayers louder this morning.</description><baseMoodEffect>-2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ===================== Setbacks: the herd ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Setback_AnimalLost</defName>
    <durationDays>4</durationDays>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="ColonyCouncil.SetbackExtension"><group>Life</group></li>
      <li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Grief</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li>
    </modExtensions>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>one of the herd was taken</label>
        <description>Something got into the pens in the night and took one of them. I found the tracks at first light, and the fence pushed in.</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>-3</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Setback_PenBroken</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="ColonyCouncil.SetbackExtension"><group>Life</group></li>
      <li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Frustration</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li>
    </modExtensions>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>the pen was broken into</label>
        <description>The pen fence was flattened in the night and the herd scattered across the fields. Half a day rounding them up, and one short at the end of it.</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>-2</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ===================== Customs of the herd's year ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_LambingWatch</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>the lambing watch</label><description>A night of lanterns and straw at the pens, and before dawn the first of the young, up on its wobbling legs.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>3</felt><feelings><li>Tenderness</li><li>Fellowship</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Dlm_Trad_Shearing</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>shearing day</label><description>Wool in my hair and down my collar, then bread and milk in the sun. One of them bolted, and it took three of us to bring it back.</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ===================== Moments and social events ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_MomentA_HerdTips</defName>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>talked animals</label><description>Leaned on the fence and swapped what we know about the herd. There's a trick with a handful of salt I want to try.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>1</felt><skillFrom>shared</skillFrom><xp>120</xp></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_MomentA_PetStories</defName>
    <durationDays>2</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>swapped animal stories</label><description>We told each other what our animals have been up to. Mine is cleverer. I didn't say so.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>1</felt><joy>0.05</joy><feelings><li>Fellowship</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_SocA_ShownTheAnimals</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>shown how to handle the animals</label><description>They taught me the animals' names and how to come up on one without spooking it.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>1</felt><skill>Animals</skill><xp>250</xp></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ===================== The herd's year and the beast that stays (Animals/HerdStory.cs, Animals/ResidentBeast.cs) ===================== -->

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Herd_FirstSpringCalf</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>the first calf of spring</label><description>The first of the year born to the herd, all legs and surprise. I'll go down and look when the work allows.</description><baseMoodEffect>2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.HeartTags"><feelings><li>Contentment</li></feelings><weight>0.3</weight></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Herd_LeaderGone</defName>
    <durationDays>4</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>the herd's old leader is gone</label><description>The herd stands about the pens as if waiting for someone to tell them where to go. So do I.</description><baseMoodEffect>-2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Beast_Fed</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>fed the beast</label><description>I left food out at the edge of the trees for a wild thing with a name, and in the morning it was gone. It knows me by now, I think.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt><feelings><li>Tenderness</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Beast_Uneasy</defName>
    <durationDays>4</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>the beast out there</label><description>There's a wild thing with a name on our land, and we're keeping the children in because of it. I look at the trees more than I used to.</description><baseMoodEffect>-1</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Beast_Hunted</defName>
    <durationDays>4</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>they hunted the one I named</label><description>I gave it a name, and the council sent the hunters after it. I know why. I still gave it a name.</description><baseMoodEffect>-2</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef ParentName="Council_MemoryBase">
    <defName>Council_Beast_PartOfTheLand</defName>
    <durationDays>5</durationDays>
    <stages><li><label>part of the land</label><description>The wild thing I named has stayed a whole season, and nobody talks of hunting it any more. It belongs here as much as we do.</description><baseMoodEffect>0</baseMoodEffect></li></stages>
    <modExtensions><li Class="ColonyCouncil.RewardInstead"><felt>2</felt><feelings><li>Contentment</li></feelings></li></modExtensions>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
